>>> not a link 
mhttp://www.foo.com
<<<
<p>mhttp://www.foo.com</p>
>>> following a newline
m
http://www.foo.com
<<<
<p>m
<a href="http://www.foo.com">http://www.foo.com</a></p>
>>> invalid domain run with underscores and repeated www.
www._www._a
<<<
<p>www._www._a</p>
>>> unmatched interior closing parentheses before trailing parenthesis
www.example.com/a)b) and www.example.com/a))b(c)
<<<
<p><a href="http://www.example.com/a)b">www.example.com/a)b</a>) and <a href="http://www.example.com/a))b(c">www.example.com/a))b(c</a>)</p>
